docs {
  # Reject Template Version (Admin)

  Rejects a single template version. Sets:

  - `approval_status = rejected`
  - `approved_by_id` = current admin user (reviewer)
  - `approved_at` = now()
  - `rejection_reason` = the optional `reason` body, persisted for the
    submitter to see in the UI.

  The body is optional; sending `{}` or no body at all also works.

  ## Permissions

  ADMIN-only.

  ## Path Parameters

  - `version_id` (UUID) — the version to reject

  ## Body (optional)

  - `reason` (string, ≤ 2000 chars) — admin-provided rejection reason.

  ## Returns

  Updated TemplateVersion with `approval_status='rejected'` and `rejection_reason` populated.
}
